REM Palette Cycle Demo
REM Cycles through available palettes, displaying each one for 3 seconds

LOG "Starting palette showcase demo"

REM Default palette
LOG "Applying palette: default"
PALETTE "default"
WAIT 2s

REM Vibrant palette
LOG "Applying palette: vibrant"
PALETTE "vibrant"
WAIT 2s

REM Muted palette
LOG "Applying palette: muted"
PALETTE "muted"
WAIT 2s

REM Warm palette
LOG "Applying palette: warm"
PALETTE "warm"
WAIT 2s

REM Cool palette
LOG "Applying palette: cool"
PALETTE "cool"
WAIT 2s

REM Neon palette
LOG "Applying palette: neonblast"
PALETTE "neonblast"
WAIT 2s

REM Night palette
LOG "Applying palette: night"
PALETTE "night"
WAIT 2s

REM Monochrome palette
LOG "Applying palette: monochrome"
PALETTE "monochrome"
WAIT 2s

REM Inverted palette
LOG "Applying palette: inverted"
PALETTE "inverted"
WAIT 2s

REM Return to default
LOG "Applying palette: default"
PALETTE "default"
WAIT 2s

LOG "Palette showcase demo completed"
